        "report": null,
        "review_body": "Shipping was quick and everything ordered was as expected.  The addresses were all super cute, flattering and very high quality.  That said,  I was disappointed with the white halter dress with a bow in the back as the shorts are fully sewn in so you have to take the whole dress off (including untying the bow) to use the restroom.  Annoying as it takes a bit of finesse to get the bow tied so it looks pretty.  May be difficult when out. Overall, very pleased with purchases.  Will just be careful to read descriptions carefully and opt for separate shorts or the easy P version. :)",
